[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d07_stocking_manifest"
title = "Community Fallout Shelter — stocking manifest"
byline = "Office of Civil Defense form C-3, stamped 19 NOV 1962"
hand = 0
body = "FACILITY
Ridgewater Lock & Dam, powerhouse sub-level
Licensed capacity   140 persons
Design occupancy    14 days

STOCKED THIS DATE

Water drums, 17.5 gal          40
Survival biscuit, carton       98
Carbohydrate supplement, tin   36
Medical kit C                   2
Sanitation kit                 14
Radiological kit, CD V-777      1

REMARKS

Shelter has own well and standby generator.
Ventilation manual, hand-cranked, sufficient
at licensed capacity.

Marked and stocked in accordance with the
National Fallout Shelter Survey. Signs posted
at both approaches this date.

Inspected           R. LINDQVIST
Position            County Civil Defense Director"
